<p class="footer">To send your letter: Copy the letter above, find your local representative’s contact info at <a href="https://www.house.gov/representatives/find-your-representative" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">house.gov</a>, and send by email or postal mail. Sharing your personal story will make your message even stronger!</p>

